      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 6G显存建议使用fp8模型\n## 经过我测试，本地6G显存使用fp8模型可以直接生成2048*2048分辨率图片（注意更新到最新版comfyui）\n\n# 6G VRAM recommended to use fp8 model\n## After my testing, local 6G VRAM can directly generate 2048*2048 resolution images using an fp8 model (note to update to the latest version of comfyui)"
      ],
      "color": "#2b446d",
      "bgcolor": "#173059"
    },
